{"id": "86103", "name": "חשבון מספרים מכוונים – חיבור מספר שלילי (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\({{CT:0}}+\\left( -{{CT:1}} \\right)=\\) [[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">Leave your answer as a <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">single</span> integer.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Replace the addition of a negative number by a subtraction, then subtract.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Adding a negative number</b><br>Remember that adding a negative number is the same as subtraction. So in this example:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}+\\left( -{{CT:1}} \\right) = {{CT:0}}-{{CT:1}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Subtract</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:3}}\"]]Here \\({{CT:0}}\\ge {{CT:1}}\\), so the result is not negative:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}-{{CT:1}} = {{CT:2}} \\]</p>[[else]]Here \\({{CT:1}}\\) is larger than \\({{CT:0}}\\), so the result is negative: subtract the smaller number from the larger one and put a minus sign in front:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}-{{CT:1}} = -\\left({{CT:1}}-{{CT:0}}\\right) = {{CT:2}} \\]</p>[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": false, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer should not contain any symbols, e.g. +,-,/ or *. Your answer should be a single integer.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "p", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}